# React & UI

Also apply **vercel-react-conventions** + skill `.agents/skills/vercel-react-best-practices/`.

- Server Components by default; `"use client"` only when required.
- Reuse `components/ui/*` — no parallel primitives.
- Shared UI → `components/` after 2+ call sites; one-offs → `app/_components/`.
- Dashboard: `DashboardShell` + `LocaleProvider` (`dashboard`). Guest chat: `AgentChat` + `LocaleProvider` (`guest`).
- Do not invent a second design system.
- Prefer `Promise.all` for independent fetches; `next/dynamic` for heavy client widgets.
- Avoid unnecessary `useMemo`/`useCallback`.
